body:

I work with Python across academic research and industry, and lead development of software platforms with responsibility for backend architecture, implementation, technical decisions, and code review.

My engineering interests include reliable automation, well-structured data workflows, maintainable software systems, and computational tools that translate complex domain knowledge into practical results.

Selected projects and architecture case studies will be added here as their public descriptions are reviewed.
